    "theorem": "GaloisCharacterPairingAudit.galois_character_pairing_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem galois_character_pairing_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] (M : Type) [CommGroup M] [Finite M] [TopologicalSpace M] [DiscreteTopology M] [TopologicalSpace (MulAut M)] [DiscreteTopology (MulAut M)] (ρ : Gamma K →ₜ* MulAut M) (hM : ∀ m : M, m ^ (Fintype.card K - 1) = 1), Nonempty (galoisCharacters K M ρ ≃* (CocycleClasses K M ρ →* Kˣ)) ∧ Nonempty (CocycleClasses K M ρ ≃* (galoisCharacters K M ρ →* Kˣ)) ∧ (∀ (χ : galoisCharacters K M ρ) (c : Cocycles K M ρ), baseUnitMap K (pairing K M ρ hM χ (QuotientGroup.mk c)) = χ.val (c.val (frobenius K))) ∧ (∀ χ ψ c, pairing K M ρ hM (χ * ψ) c = pairing K M ρ hM χ c * pairing K M ρ hM ψ c) ∧ (∀ χ c d, pairing K M ρ hM χ (c * d) = pairing K M ρ hM χ c * pairing K M ρ hM χ d) ∧ (∀ χ, (∀ c, pairing K M ρ hM χ c = 1) → χ = 1) ∧ (∀ c, (∀ χ, pairing K M ρ hM χ c = 1) → c = 1) ∧ Nat.card (galoisCharacters K M ρ) = Nat.card (CocycleClasses K M ρ)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [CharP K 2], (∀ χ : TwoCharacters K, χ = 1) ∧ missingTwoClass K ≠ 1 ∧ (¬ ∃ e : TwoCharacters K →* (TwoClasses K →* Kˣ), ∀ c : TwoClasses K, (∀ χ : TwoCharacters K, e χ c = 1) → c = 1) ∧ ¬ ∀ m : TwoTarget, m ^ (Fintype.card K - 1) = 1)",
    "decl_sha256": "117deabc6ffa81828e499acbcc42d2c0a96947d2d3e5605128590db25ba4aee7",
    "scope": "Bruin2011 Lemma2.1 finite-module displayed pairing: every actual finite field K, actual algebraic closure Omega and Krull absolute Galois group Gamma with derived q-Frobenius density; finite Abelian M with actual continuous action and exponent dividing q-1. Actual Gamma-equivariant homomorphisms M to Omega units descend uniquely to K-unit characters via actual Frobenius fixed field and annihilation. All-Gamma invariance derived from actual density. Compose actual all-continuous-crossed-cocycle / all-principal-cocycle class quotient with credited finite-field character biduality. Both duality MulEquivs, exact source Omega-unit evaluation formula on every cocycle representative, both bilinear laws, both trivial radicals and equal cardinality are proved without duality, nondegeneracy, H1 value or descent premises. Every finite characteristic-2 K, actual M=Multiplicative(ZMod2) with trivial action: actual Omega-unit characters all trivial, actual continuous-cocycle class nonzero, no right-nondegenerate bilinear homomorphism on the same domains; annihilation hypothesis false. Qualified source case proved, deleting hypothesis refuted. Seven prior core files copied byte-identical, credited PCC-20261115-ed6495/PCC-20261114-cdb4f1; credited PowerTargets prime-power root argument. Separate Mathlib continuous homogeneous-complex H1 comparison, isogeny-kernel/Lang/Cartier group scheme/Jacobian/divisor/full Tate/MOV/Frey-Ruck bridges remain open. Original FR94 primary remains unread. Bruin2011 DOI10.5802/jtnb.764 full six article pages previously read/seven PDF pages inspected; current selected printed325/PDF4 Galois-Cartier definition/Eq2.1/Lemma2.1 rechecked. Copyright primary files local only. No novelty/canonical corpus promotion/full14 completion. Standard foundations/defaults, no holes/custom axioms/native proof evaluation/raised limits/global flags/waivers/frozen edits/cryptographic Python/native cryptographic experiment/spend/upload. Native complete written-header processing procedural, not kernel parser/hash/execution/physical-host refinement. Signed standing unverified.",
